{"seq":3,"slug":"websocket-and-grpc","title":"WebSocket 与 gRPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/websocket-and-grpc","wordCount":752,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"websocket-与-grpc\">WebSocket 与 gRPC</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebSocket 与 gRPC 都在解决同一个问题：HTTP 的原始请求-响应模型无法满足&quot;服务器主动推送&quot;和&quot;长期双向通信&quot;。WebSocket 通过一次 HTTP Upgrade 握手，把连接变成浏览器原生支持的全双工通道；gRPC 则把 HTTP/2 的多路复用与流语义暴露出来，叠加 Protobuf 的强类型契约，面向服务间调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    NEED[需要服务器主动推送/长连接] --&gt; REQ{通信方向}&#10;    REQ --&gt;|单向服务器→客户端| SSE[SSE: 基于 HTTP 文本流]&#10;    REQ --&gt;|双向, 浏览器| WS[WebSocket: Upgrade 全双工]&#10;    REQ --&gt;|双向, 服务间| GRPC[gRPC: HTTP/2 + Protobuf]\">graph TD\n    NEED[需要服务器主动推送/长连接] --&gt; REQ{通信方向}\n    REQ --&gt;|单向服务器→客户端| SSE[SSE: 基于 HTTP 文本流]\n    REQ --&gt;|双向, 浏览器| WS[WebSocket: Upgrade 全双工]\n    REQ --&gt;|双向, 服务间| GRPC[gRPC: HTTP/2 + Protobuf]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>底层</th>\n<th>数据格式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>本文对应小节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSE</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>通知推送、日志流</td>\n<td>选型建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>独立协议（Upgrade）</td>\n<td>文本 / 二进制</td>\n<td>聊天、游戏、协同编辑</td>\n<td>WebSocket 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC</td>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n<td>Protobuf（二进制）</td>\n<td>微服务间通信</td>\n<td>gRPC 协议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的关键问三件事：是否需要双向、是否需要浏览器直接支持、是否需要强类型契约。单向推送用 SSE 最省事，浏览器双向选 WebSocket，服务间高性能调用选 gRPC——三者并非互相替代，常在同一系统中并存。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要实时通信\">为什么需要实时通信</h2><p>传统 HTTP 是请求-响应模型，客户端必须主动发起请求才能获取数据。对于实时聊天、股票行情、协同编辑等场景，需要服务器能主动向客户端推送数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;    Note over C,S: HTTP 轮询(低效)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 没有&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 没有&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 有! 这是消息\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n    Note over C,S: HTTP 轮询(低效)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 没有\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 没有\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 有新消息吗?\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 有! 这是消息</pre><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;    Note over C,S: WebSocket(高效 - 全双工持久连接)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 建立 WebSocket 连接&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 这是新消息!&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 又有新消息!&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 发送消息\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n    Note over C,S: WebSocket(高效 - 全双工持久连接)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 建立 WebSocket 连接\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 这是新消息!\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 又有新消息!\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 发送消息</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"websocket-协议\">WebSocket 协议</h2><h3 id=\"websocket-握手\">WebSocket 握手</h3><p>WebSocket 通过 HTTP Upgrade 机制建立连接，握手后切换为 WebSocket 协议。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端请求：&#10;  GET /chat HTTP/1.1&#10;  Host: example.com&#10;  Upgrade: websocket&#10;  Connection: Upgrade&#10;  Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==&#10;  Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13&#10;&#10;服务端响应：&#10;  HTTP/1.1 101 Switching Protocols&#10;  Upgrade: websocket&#10;  Connection: Upgrade&#10;  Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端请求：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  GET /chat HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Host: example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Upgrade: websocket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Connection: Upgrade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>服务端响应：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  HTTP/1.1 101 Switching Protocols</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Upgrade: websocket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Connection: Upgrade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=</span></span></code></pre></div><p>握手完成后，连接从 HTTP 升级为 WebSocket，双方可以自由地双向发送消息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"websocket-帧格式\">WebSocket 帧格式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"block\" data-source=\"block-beta&#10;    columns 1&#10;    block:flags:1&#10;        columns 4&#10;        FIN[&quot;FIN 1位&quot;] RSV[&quot;RSV1-3 3位&quot;] OP[&quot;opcode 4位&quot;] MASK[&quot;MASK 1位 + Payload len 7位&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    EXT[&quot;Extended payload length 16/64位&quot;]&#10;    KEY[&quot;Masking-key 0或4字节&quot;]&#10;    DATA[&quot;Payload Data&quot;]\">block-beta\n    columns 1\n    block:flags:1\n        columns 4\n        FIN[\"FIN 1位\"] RSV[\"RSV1-3 3位\"] OP[\"opcode 4位\"] MASK[\"MASK 1位 + Payload len 7位\"]\n    end\n    EXT[\"Extended payload length 16/64位\"]\n    KEY[\"Masking-key 0或4字节\"]\n    DATA[\"Payload Data\"]</pre><h3 id=\"websocket-客户端示例\">WebSocket 客户端示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const ws = new WebSocket(&#39;wss://example.com/chat&#39;);&#10;&#10;ws.onopen = () =&gt; {&#10;  ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;join&#39;, room: &#39;general&#39; }));&#10;};&#10;&#10;ws.onmessage = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);&#10;  console.log(&#39;收到消息:&#39;, data);&#10;};&#10;&#10;ws.onclose = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`连接关闭: ${event.code} ${event.reason}`);&#10;};&#10;&#10;ws.onerror = (error) =&gt; {&#10;  console.error(&#39;WebSocket 错误:&#39;, error);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebSocket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wss://example.com/chat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onopen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'join'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, room: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'general'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'收到消息:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onclose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`连接关闭: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">code</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onerror</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WebSocket 错误:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"grpc-协议\">gRPC 协议</h2><p>gRPC 是 Google 开发的高性能 RPC 框架，基于 HTTP/2 和 Protocol Buffers（Protobuf）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"protobuf-定义\">Protobuf 定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;package chat;&#10;&#10;service ChatService {&#10;  rpc SendMessage (MessageRequest) returns (MessageResponse);&#10;  rpc Subscribe (SubscribeRequest) returns (stream ChatMessage);&#10;  rpc Chat (stream ChatMessage) returns (stream ChatMessage);&#10;}&#10;&#10;message MessageRequest {&#10;  string room_id = 1;&#10;  string content = 2;&#10;  string sender = 3;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message MessageResponse {&#10;  string message_id = 1;&#10;  int64 timestamp = 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message ChatMessage {&#10;  string sender = 1;&#10;  string content = 2;&#10;  int64 timestamp = 3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package chat;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service ChatService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc SendMessage (MessageRequest) returns (MessageResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc Subscribe (SubscribeRequest) returns (stream ChatMessage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc Chat (stream ChatMessage) returns (stream ChatMessage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message MessageRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string room_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string content = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string sender = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message MessageResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string message_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 timestamp = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message ChatMessage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string sender = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string content = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 timestamp = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"grpc-四种通信模式\">gRPC 四种通信模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unary</td>\n<td>一请求一响应</td>\n<td>普通 API 调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Streaming</td>\n<td>一请求多响应</td>\n<td>实时数据推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client Streaming</td>\n<td>多请求一响应</td>\n<td>文件上传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bidirectional</td>\n<td>多请求多响应</td>\n<td>实时聊天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Unary&#10;        C1[&quot;Client&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;req&quot;| S1[&quot;Server&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;res&quot;| C1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Server Streaming&#10;        C2[&quot;Client&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;req&quot;| S2[&quot;Server&quot;] ==&gt;|&quot;res stream&quot;| C2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Client Streaming&#10;        C3[&quot;Client&quot;] ==&gt;|&quot;req stream&quot;| S3[&quot;Server&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;res&quot;| C3&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Bidirectional&#10;        C4[&quot;Client&quot;] ==&gt;|&quot;req stream&quot;| S4[&quot;Server&quot;]&#10;        S4 ==&gt;|&quot;res stream&quot;| C4&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Unary\n        C1[\"Client\"] --&gt;|\"req\"| S1[\"Server\"] --&gt;|\"res\"| C1\n    end\n    subgraph Server Streaming\n        C2[\"Client\"] --&gt;|\"req\"| S2[\"Server\"] ==&gt;|\"res stream\"| C2\n    end\n    subgraph Client Streaming\n        C3[\"Client\"] ==&gt;|\"req stream\"| S3[\"Server\"] --&gt;|\"res\"| C3\n    end\n    subgraph Bidirectional\n        C4[\"Client\"] ==&gt;|\"req stream\"| S4[\"Server\"]\n        S4 ==&gt;|\"res stream\"| C4\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"http-sse-vs-websocket-vs-grpc\">HTTP SSE vs WebSocket vs gRPC</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>SSE</th>\n<th>WebSocket</th>\n<th>gRPC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>独立协议</td>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td>服务器→客户端</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>文本/二进制</td>\n<td>Protobuf（二进制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>需要 gRPC-Web</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动重连</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>通知推送、日志流</td>\n<td>聊天、游戏</td>\n<td>微服务间通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"流式处理\">流式处理</h2><h3 id=\"websocket-流式处理\">WebSocket 流式处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const WebSocket = require(&#39;ws&#39;);&#10;const wss = new WebSocket.Server({ port: 8080 });&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws) =&gt; {&#10;  const interval = setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {&#10;      ws.send(&#10;        JSON.stringify({&#10;          type: &#39;ticker&#39;,&#10;          price: (Math.random() * 1000).toFixed(2),&#10;          timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;        }),&#10;      );&#10;    }&#10;  }, 1000);&#10;&#10;  ws.on(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; clearInterval(interval));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> WebSocket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ws'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebSocket.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ port: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wss.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'connection'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> interval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ws.readyState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebSocket.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OPEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ticker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          price: (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          timestamp: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'close'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clearInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(interval));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"grpc-优势-强类型与代码生成\">gRPC 优势：强类型与代码生成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PROTO[&quot;.proto 文件定义服务&quot;] --&gt; PROTOC[&quot;protoc 编译器&quot;]&#10;    PROTOC --&gt; GO[&quot;Go 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端&quot;]&#10;    PROTOC --&gt; JS[&quot;JS 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端&quot;]&#10;    PROTOC --&gt; JAVA[&quot;Java 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    PROTO[\".proto 文件定义服务\"] --&gt; PROTOC[\"protoc 编译器\"]\n    PROTOC --&gt; GO[\"Go 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端\"]\n    PROTOC --&gt; JS[\"JS 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端\"]\n    PROTOC --&gt; JAVA[\"Java 代码\\n客户端 + 服务端\"]</pre><p>自动生成类型安全的客户端和服务端代码</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"选型建议\">选型建议</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q{&quot;需要浏览器实时推送?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;仅服务器推送&quot;| SSE[&quot;SSE&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;双向通信&quot;| WS[&quot;WebSocket&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;微服务通信&quot;| GRPC[&quot;gRPC&quot;]&#10;    Q2{&quot;需要高性能微服务间通信?&quot;} --&gt; GRPC&#10;    Q3{&quot;需要浏览器兼容性?&quot;} --&gt; WS&#10;    Q3 --&gt; SSE&#10;    Q4{&quot;需要强类型契约?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;gRPC + Protobuf&quot;| GRPC&#10;    Q5{&quot;需要跨语言支持?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;代码生成&quot;| GRPC\">flowchart TD\n    Q{\"需要浏览器实时推送?\"} --&gt;|\"仅服务器推送\"| SSE[\"SSE\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"双向通信\"| WS[\"WebSocket\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"微服务通信\"| GRPC[\"gRPC\"]\n    Q2{\"需要高性能微服务间通信?\"} --&gt; GRPC\n    Q3{\"需要浏览器兼容性?\"} --&gt; WS\n    Q3 --&gt; SSE\n    Q4{\"需要强类型契约?\"} --&gt;|\"gRPC + Protobuf\"| GRPC\n    Q5{\"需要跨语言支持?\"} --&gt;|\"代码生成\"| GRPC</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WebSocket 通过 HTTP Upgrade 建立全双工连接，适合浏览器端的实时双向通信。</li>\n<li>gRPC 基于 HTTP/2 和 Protobuf，提供高性能、强类型的 RPC 通信，适合微服务间调用。</li>\n<li>SSE 是最简单的服务器推送方案，内置自动重连，适合单向数据流场景。</li>\n<li>gRPC 的四种通信模式（Unary、流式）覆盖了各种通信需求。</li>\n<li>选型需综合考虑通信方向、浏览器兼容性、性能要求和类型安全需求。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebSocket 与 gRPC","id":"websocket-与-grpc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要实时通信","id":"为什么需要实时通信"},{"level":2,"text":"WebSocket 协议","id":"websocket-协议"},{"level":3,"text":"WebSocket 握手","id":"websocket-握手"},{"level":3,"text":"WebSocket 帧格式","id":"websocket-帧格式"},{"level":3,"text":"WebSocket 客户端示例","id":"websocket-客户端示例"},{"level":2,"text":"gRPC 协议","id":"grpc-协议"},{"level":3,"text":"Protobuf 定义","id":"protobuf-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"gRPC 四种通信模式","id":"grpc-四种通信模式"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP SSE vs WebSocket vs gRPC","id":"http-sse-vs-websocket-vs-grpc"},{"level":2,"text":"流式处理","id":"流式处理"},{"level":3,"text":"WebSocket 流式处理","id":"websocket-流式处理"},{"level":3,"text":"gRPC 优势：强类型与代码生成","id":"grpc-优势-强类型与代码生成"},{"level":2,"text":"选型建议","id":"选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DNS 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/dns-system"},"next":{"title":"邮件与 FTP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/application-layer/email-and-ftp"}}